   126	1. **Fix `02-cra-roles` CHECK Marker Placement:** Move `<!-- CHECK: 02-cra-roles -->` up by one sentence to immediately follow `...affected part or whole.` so it directly receipts the statutory definition of manufacturer obligations under CRA Articles 21–22.
